  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#1D5FD0>Teaching example \xB7 20 \xB5L per active reaction</color>\n\n2\xD7
    SYBR Green supermix<pos=440>10 \xB5L\nForward primer (10 \xB5M)<pos=440>0.6 \xB5L\nReverse
    primer (10 \xB5M)<pos=440>0.6 \xB5L\nDNA template<pos=440>2 \xB5L\nNuclease-free
    water<pos=440>6.8 \xB5L\n\n<b>NTC: replace the 2 \xB5L of DNA with water.</b>\nFinal
    supermix: 1\xD7. Each primer: 300 nM.\n\nThe supermix already contains polymerase,
    nucleotides, magnesium and SYBR dye.\n\n26 samples + 1 positive control + 1 NTC.\nThe
    other 68 wells are unused.\n\nComposition based on Bio-Rad iTaq guidance. The
    team's 35-cycle programme is a classroom example, not a validated diagnostic
    assay."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d47d0a40436a53940b71b353efe9623a, type: 2}
